  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the T&#xFC;rkiye &#x2013; Italy Bilateral Cooperation on Cross Mediterranean Migration Irregular Flows</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to improved management of migration flows and cross-border mobility in the Mediterranean, through better cooperation, including dialogue and measures to enhance security and safety throughout the mobility continuum. Specifically, the activities aim to improve the mutual exchange of good practices through field study exchanges and cooperation between countries along the migratory routes. The planned activities such as the assessment of cultural and language diversity in the management of migration, direct assistance support to migrants in vulnerable situations, promotion of cooperation and networking among civil society organizations, universities, public institutions at national, regional and local levels, and the promotion of increased understanding of basic concepts of migration and migration policy and public communication on migration will contribute to enhance migration management.</narrative>
  </description>
